      | ORDER-012  | RECALL/TICKET    | New            | 20250321T110000.00000000Z | 5000      | 0       | 0.0       | GOOG   | USD      | INCOME_FUND | Normal       | Standard      | null     |
      | ORDER-012  | RECALL/TO/OMS    | PendingNew     | 20250321T110100.00000000Z | 5000      | 0       | 0.0       |        |          |             |              |               | null     |
      | ORDER-012  | OMS/TO/RECALL    | New            | 20250321T110200.00000000Z | 5000      | 0       | 0.0       |        |          |             |              |               | '0'      |
      | ORDER-012  | RECALL/TO/OMS    | PendingFill    | 20250321T110300.00000000Z | 5000      | 5000    | 50.75     |        |          |             |              |               | null     |
      | ORDER-012  | OMS/TO/RECALL    | Filled         | 20250321T110400.00000000Z | 5000      | 5000    | 50.75     |        |          |             |              |               | '2'      |
    When the system initializes and rebuilds the cache
    Then the cache should contain 1 orders
    And the order "ORDER-012" should be in state "Filled" 
